r (https://twitter.com/icgmcmc/status/1769245613684879745) and thought it was very cute! I would like to commission you to draw my 2 friends for their birthdays happening very early April.\nAre you able to use real life pictures as reference? And can you please draw them separately.\n\nFor \"Friend A\" please draw them in a gothic casual style. With a hoodie and pants. Some loose references provided are: \"Friend-A_Outfit-1\" and \"Friend-A_Outfit-2\". She also has purple hair.\nFor \"Friend B\" please draw them in a tech-wear style. The loose references provided are \"Friend-B_Outfit-1\" and \"Friend-B_Outfit-2\".\n\nThe outfit references do not have to be exact, but mostly just following the style and being mostly black & cute. Thank you <3\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kU9Kn1kNDM0sBhv1TneArL-Hs0GvutPG?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@icgmcmc/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2d0da635/uploads/origins/cbc522a5-6fee-4ab8-bec7-3311003ce33b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2987ae0813cb083d5ad4b608d627d07e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2d0da635/uploads/origins/cbc522a5-6fee-4ab8-bec7-3311003ce33b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2987ae0813cb083d5ad4b608d627d07e, https://si.imgix.net/2d0da635/uploads/origins/cbc522a5-6fee-4ab8-bec7-3311003ce33b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d4a13d45f001cc11ce49728efc26d87 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2d0da635/uploads/origins/cbc522a5-6fee-4ab8-bec7-3311003ce33b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac6b464bcce679968d326b36e53dcb81 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi hi! It's me again, Mecha Mara the catgirl android vtuber! I really think your artwork is cute and adorable. I was wondering if you could draw a cute picture of me with my robot cat chat mascot! Thank you! ♥\n\nHere are both of